# build-ws-frame returns a dict with keys: header, payload, frame.
# Mask-key constructed with chr() since LLT only supports \n \t \r escapes.

[include %libdir "protocols/websocket.llt"]
---
[keys [call %.build-ws-frame 1 "Hi" [str [chr 1] [chr 2] [chr 3] [chr 4]]]]
=== out
Dict({0: String("header"), 1: String("payload"), 2: String("frame")})
